1Institute for Systems and Computer Engineering, Technology and Science, 4200-465 Porto, Portugal 2Department of Engineering, University of Trás-os-Montes e Alto Douro, 5001-801 Vila Real, Portugal 3Department of Education and Psychology, University of Trás-os-Montes e Alto Douro, 5001-801 Vila Real, Portugal
